PHP 8.1 for Windows on arm64: php-src's Windows arm64 support, which landed
in 8.2, ported to 8.1.34 as pv builds it (after build/backports/php-8.1.list).
Applied by build/build-php-windows.sh with `git apply` before building.

Ported from these php-src commits:
  02881a76a8  Port win32/codepage.c codes for windows arm64
  279a297172  Windows arm64 build system support (incl. the armasm fiber
              assembly); 8.1's fiber block in win32/build/config.w32 and the
              crc32_x86.c line in ext/standard/config.w32 adapted by hand
  3a843f953b  Windows arm64 zend and standard extension support; the
              Zend/zend_atomic.h hunk dropped (no zend_atomic in 8.1), the
              json_encoder.c MSVC workaround adapted to 8.1's int return,
              and string.c's arm_neon.h include adapted to 8.1's #if
  2be3aa86f0  gd's emmintrin.h on Windows arm64; its zend_vm_execute hunks
              do not apply, 8.1 having no execute_ex_real trampoline
  e2da6b4bf9  Use the default archive names for Windows ARM64 builds

